# "Deal combat damage to one or more players": a Human Knight blocked by Bot2's Ornithopter (0/2) deals all of its 2 damage to the Ornithopter (lethal damage first, so no
# trample damage goes through) and nothing to Bot2, so Bot1 does not become the monarch. (The unblocked attack that does is in the original scenario.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Plateau
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Forth Eorlingas!
Plateau x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plateau.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Plateau.Activate(Ability: {R})
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Forth Eorlingas!.Cast(X: 1)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Human Knight Token)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Human Knight Token)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Monarch = (absent)
